    "image": "docs/v22-copy-pixels/repeat-source-before-after.jpg",
    "observations": [
      "Violet, Sloth, Fallen Knight and Siren retain exact own art and switch to available authored charge state before repeat release.",
      "Paired Han Rian and Baek Ion retain their individual static owned bodies; absence of a charge-specific source pose is not disguised as a new animation.",
      "Violet tick502 now shows authored recovery instead of a skipped final-volley attack pose. Actual core release marker remains433 and lifetime remains511."
